@startuml
title Tabel Referensi - Booking & Pembayaran (Jejak Rimba)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A5568

note as T1
**Tabel Status Booking**
|===
| Status | Keterangan | Aktor yang Bisa Ubah
| menunggu_konfirmasi | Booking baru dibuat, menunggu pembayaran | Sistem
| dikonfirmasi | Pembayaran sukses, vendor sudah setuju | Vendor
| sedang_berjalan | Alat sedang disewa oleh pelanggan | Vendor
| selesai | Alat dikembalikan, sewa berakhir | Vendor / Sistem
| dibatalkan | Dibatalkan oleh pelanggan/vendor | Pelanggan / Vendor
|===
end note

note as T2
**Tabel Aktor & Tanggung Jawab**
|===
| Aktor | Aktivitas Utama
| Pelanggan | Pilih alat, isi data, bayar, lihat status, beri ulasan
| Sistem | Validasi, cek stok, hitung harga, bikin booking, panggil Midtrans, update status, kirim notif
| Vendor | Konfirmasi booking, terima kembali alat, update status jadi selesai
|===
end note

note as T3
**Tabel Decision Points (Guard Conditions)**
|===
| Decision Point | Guard True | Guard False
| Data Valid? | [Ya] → lanjut cek stok | [Tidak] → error validasi
| Stok Tersedia? | [Stok Ada] → hitung & bikin booking | [Stok Kosong] → error stok
| Midtrans Aktif? | [Ya] → buat snap token | [Tidak] → arahkan ke status
| Hasil Bayar? | [Sukses/Pending] → update status | [Gagal/Ditutup] → error
|===
end note

note as T4
**Tabel Entitas Data Utama**
|===
| Entitas | Field Penting
| bookings | id, renter_id, equipment_id, start_date, end_date, total_price, status, notes
| equipment | id, name, category, price_per_day, stock, condition, vendor_id
| vendors | id, business_name, whatsapp_number, address, is_active
| profiles | id, full_name, phone_number, role (penyewa/vendor)
|===
end note

@enduml